#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"platform-sep26\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "September 2026 {#september-2026}"
msgstr "September 2026 {#september-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The first Nighthawk r2 QPU is now available** &mdash; Premium, Flex, and Pay-As-You-Go Plans now have access to `ibm_phoenix`, the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk r2 QPU and our fastest processor yet. `ibm_phoenix` is a high-connectivity, square-lattice 120-programmable-qubit device that delivers up to 25× higher throughput than Heron while matching its fidelity. \n"
msgstr "**QPU Nighthawk r2 pertama kini tersedia** &mdash; Premium, Flex, dan Pay-As-You-Go Plan kini mempunyai akses kepada `ibm_phoenix`, QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk r2 pertama dan pemproses kami yang paling pantas setakat ini. `ibm_phoenix` ialah peranti 120-qubit boleh diprogramkan bersambungan tinggi, kekisi segi empat sama yang menyampaikan daya pemprosesan sehingga 25× lebih tinggi berbanding Heron sambil menyamai fideliti Heron. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The gains come from a newly introduced independent high-speed reset that returns every programmable qubit to the ground state faster and more completely. As a result, the default repetition delay is 1 µs (previously 250 µs), which pushes throughput above 100,000 Max Circuits Per Second (MCPS). For more about how IBM tracks quantum hardware performance across metrics of scale, quality, and speed, see [this blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/hardware-metrics-2026).\n"
msgstr "  Peningkatan ini datang daripada tetapan semula berkelajuan tinggi bebas yang baharu diperkenalkan yang mengembalikan setiap qubit boleh diprogramkan kepada keadaan asas dengan lebih pantas dan lebih lengkap. Hasilnya, kelewatan pengulangan lalai ialah 1 µs (sebelum ini 250 µs), yang menolak daya pemprosesan melebihi 100,000 Litar Maksimum Sesaat (MCPS). Untuk mengetahui lebih lanjut mengenai cara IBM menjejaki prestasi perkakasan kuantum merentasi metrik skala, kualiti, dan kelajuan, lihat [blog ini](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/hardware-metrics-2026).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The increased speed and connectivity make it possible to do more usable work from the same capacity, with the largest, most demanding workloads benefitting the most. Larger experiments, broader parameter sweeps, and methods that were once too costly at scale are now practical to run routinely.\n"
msgstr "  Kelajuan dan kesambungan yang meningkat menjadikannya mungkin untuk melakukan lebih banyak kerja yang boleh digunakan daripada kapasiti yang sama, dengan beban kerja terbesar dan paling menuntut mendapat manfaat paling banyak. Eksperimen yang lebih besar, imbasan parameter yang lebih luas, dan kaedah yang dahulunya terlalu mahal pada skala kini praktikal untuk dijalankan secara rutin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `ibm_phoenix` is also built for the next era of quantum error correction research. Alongside high-speed reset, it supports mid-circuit reset and dynamic circuits for real-time control over error correction.\n"
msgstr "  `ibm_phoenix` juga dibina untuk era seterusnya penyelidikan pembetulan ralat kuantum. Selain tetapan semula berkelajuan tinggi, ia menyokong tetapan semula pertengahan litar dan litar dinamik untuk kawalan masa nyata ke atas pembetulan ralat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"platform-aug26\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "August 2026 {#august-2026}"
msgstr "Ogos 2026 {#august-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updates to IBM Quantum Platform** &mdash; A recent update to IBM Quantum Platform makes it easier to understand your job results, unlocks powerful new circuit design capabilities in Composer, and keeps you informed about your usage limits — so you can focus more on your quantum work.\n"
msgstr "**Kemas kini kepada IBM Quantum Platform** &mdash; Kemas kini terkini kepada IBM Quantum Platform memudahkan anda memahami keputusan kerja anda, membuka kunci keupayaan reka bentuk litar baharu yang berkuasa dalam Composer, dan terus memaklumkan anda tentang had penggunaan anda — supaya anda boleh memberi lebih tumpuan kepada kerja kuantum anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job results & workloads  \n"
msgstr "Keputusan kerja & beban kerja  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Bit-by-bit outcomes view** — a new way to view Sampler measurement results, breaking down outcomes bit by bit instead of by full state. Useful as an alternative to the Measurement outcomes view when results contain many distinct states.  \n"
msgstr "**Paparan hasil bit demi bit** — cara baharu untuk melihat keputusan pengukuran Sampler, memecahkan hasil bit demi bit dan bukannya mengikut keadaan penuh. Berguna sebagai alternatif kepada paparan Hasil pengukuran apabila keputusan mengandungi banyak keadaan berbeza.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit timing chart** — shows a scheduled timeline of a circuit's operations (gates, channels, durations). Available for Sampler and Executor jobs. Requires [enabling timing data retrieval](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing#enable-timing-data-retrieval).  \n"
msgstr "**Carta masa litar** — menunjukkan garis masa berjadual bagi operasi litar (get, saluran, tempoh). Tersedia untuk kerja Sampler dan Executor. Memerlukan [pendayaan pengambilan data masa](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing#enable-timing-data-retrieval).  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Chunk/span execution diagnostics panel** — a new panel on job details showing chunk- and span-level execution diagnostics. See [Sampler input/output](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/sampler-input-output) for what this data means and how to enable it when submitting jobs.  \n"
msgstr "**Panel diagnostik pelaksanaan chunk/span** — panel baharu pada butiran kerja yang menunjukkan diagnostik pelaksanaan peringkat chunk dan span. Lihat [Input/output Sampler](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/sampler-input-output) untuk maksud data ini dan cara mendayakannya semasa menghantar kerja.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Device calibration data at a glance** — job details now show the device calibration data from the time of submission or execution via a \"View calibration history\" link.  \n"
msgstr "**Data kalibrasi peranti sekilas pandang** — butiran kerja kini menunjukkan data kalibrasi peranti dari masa penghantaran atau pelaksanaan melalui pautan \"View calibration history\".  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Executor results visualization** — job details pages now render results for Executor jobs. See the [Directed execution model (beta)](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/directed-execution-model) guide for more on Executor.  \n"
msgstr "**Visualisasi hasil Executor** — halaman butiran kerja kini memaparkan hasil untuk kerja Executor. Lihat panduan [Model pelaksanaan terarah (beta)](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/directed-execution-model) untuk maklumat lanjut tentang Executor.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Dynamic circuits now render on job details** — with OpenQASM 3.0 support in Composer (see more below), circuits that previously failed to render (for example, those using dynamic circuits) now display correctly on the job details page.  \n"
msgstr "**Litar dinamik kini dipaparkan pada butiran kerja** — dengan sokongan OpenQASM 3.0 dalam Composer (lihat lagi di bawah), litar yang sebelum ini gagal dipaparkan (contohnya, yang menggunakan litar dinamik) kini dipaparkan dengan betul pada halaman butiran kerja.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Histogram improvements** — faster loading, smoother zoom in/out, and a new selection tool for narrowing in on specific result ranges.  \n"
msgstr "**Penambahbaikan histogram** — pemuatan lebih pantas, zum masuk/keluar lebih lancar, dan alat pemilihan baharu untuk menumpukan pada julat hasil tertentu.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`qiskit-ibm-runtime` code snippets in job results** — copy-ready code to retrieve a job by ID; for Executor jobs, an additional snippet lets you replicate the job.  \n"
msgstr "**Serpihan kod `qiskit-ibm-runtime` dalam hasil kerja** — kod sedia guna untuk mengambil kerja mengikut ID; untuk kerja Executor, serpihan tambahan membolehkan anda meniru kerja tersebut.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Custom date range filter** added to the workloads table.  \n"
msgstr "**Penapis julat tarikh tersuai** ditambah pada jadual beban kerja.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Clickable instance names and tags** in workload detail pages, linking to the related resource.  \n"
msgstr "**Nama dan tag instans boleh diklik** dalam halaman butiran beban kerja, memaut ke sumber berkaitan.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Navigate to your results on the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) page to see these improvements.  \n"
msgstr "    Navigasi ke hasil anda pada halaman [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) untuk melihat penambahbaikan ini.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Composer: OpenQASM v3.0 support  \n"
msgstr "Composer: sokongan OpenQASM v3.0  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Composer now supports OpenQASM v3.0, adding:  \n"
msgstr "    Composer kini menyokong OpenQASM v3.0, menambahkan:  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Gate modifiers** — ctrl, inv, pow, etc.  \n"
msgstr "**Pengubah suai Gate** — ctrl, inv, pow, dan lain-lain.  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Loops** — for and while  \n"
msgstr "**Gelung** — for dan while  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Conditional logic** — if/else  \n"
msgstr "**Logik bersyarat** — if/else  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Box annotations** — group and label sections of a circuit  \n"
msgstr "**Anotasi kotak** — kumpulkan dan labelkan bahagian litar  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Also included: smoother rendering for large circuits, and a fix for PNG exports failing on large circuits.  \n"
msgstr "    Turut disertakan: rendering yang lebih lancar untuk litar besar, dan pembetulan untuk eksport PNG yang gagal pada litar besar.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Visit the [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) to explore this new update.\n"
msgstr "  Lawati [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) untuk meneroka kemas kini baharu ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance usage limits  \n"
msgstr "Had penggunaan instans  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium and Open Plan instances that hit their usage limit now display the exact date access resumes, based on the rolling usage window.  \n"
msgstr "Instans Premium dan Open Plan yang mencapai had penggunaan kini memaparkan tarikh tepat akses disambung semula, berdasarkan tetingkap penggunaan bergolek.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  See more on your [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.  \n"
msgstr "  Lihat lebih lanjut pada halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) anda.  \n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "July 2026 {#july-2026}"
msgstr "Julai 2026 {#july-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qr-rename\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime rename {#qiskit-runtime-rename}"
msgstr "Penukaran nama Qiskit Runtime {#qiskit-runtime-rename}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qiskit Runtime service is now IBM Quantum Compute Service** &mdash; This is a naming change only and does not require any code changes or updates to existing applications. You might notice the new name throughout the user interface and documentation.\n"
msgstr "**Perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime kini IBM Quantum Compute Service** &mdash; Ini hanyalah perubahan nama dan tidak memerlukan sebarang perubahan kod atau kemas kini kepada aplikasi sedia ada. Anda mungkin perasan nama baharu ini di seluruh antara muka pengguna dan dokumentasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Historically, the term _Qiskit Runtime_ was used to refer to three related but distinct concepts.\n"
msgstr "    Secara sejarahnya, istilah _Qiskit Runtime_ digunakan untuk merujuk kepada tiga konsep berkaitan tetapi berbeza.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Any hardware provider that wants Qiskit users to run workloads on its quantum computers must provide two provider-specific components:\n"
msgstr "    Mana-mana penyedia perkakasan yang mahu pengguna Qiskit menjalankan beban kerja pada komputer kuantum mereka mesti menyediakan dua komponen khusus penyedia:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Qiskit SDK extension, which enables users to submit jobs to the provider. In IBM's case, this is the open-source `qiskit-ibm-runtime` library. Rather than communicating directly with the quantum computer, it submits jobs to a cloud API.\n"
msgstr "Sambungan Qiskit SDK, yang membolehkan pengguna menghantar kerja kepada penyedia. Dalam kes IBM, ini adalah pustaka sumber terbuka `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Daripada berkomunikasi terus dengan komputer kuantum, ia menghantar kerja kepada API awan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A runtime execution environment, which runs on the quantum computer itself. This component understands Qiskit primitives, translates them into hardware-specific operations, and executes them on the quantum hardware. In IBM's case, this is IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Persekitaran pelaksanaan runtime, yang berjalan pada komputer kuantum itu sendiri. Komponen ini memahami primitif Qiskit, menterjemahkannya kepada operasi khusus perkakasan, dan melaksanakannya pada perkakasan kuantum. Dalam kes IBM, ini adalah IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Between these two components sits a third element: the managed cloud service that receives jobs from the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` SDK and orchestrates their execution. This service is responsible for capabilities such as authentication, scheduling, queue management, workload routing, usage tracking, limits, and analytics. It does not process Qiskit primitives itself; instead, it dispatches workloads to the appropriate quantum computer, where the runtime execution environment performs the actual execution.\n"
msgstr "    Di antara dua komponen ini terdapat elemen ketiga: perkhidmatan awan terurus yang menerima kerja daripada SDK `qiskit-ibm-runtime` dan menyelaraskan pelaksanaannya. Perkhidmatan ini bertanggungjawab untuk keupayaan seperti pengesahan, penjadualan, pengurusan giliran, penghalaan beban kerja, penjejakan penggunaan, had, dan analitik. Ia tidak memproses primitif Qiskit itu sendiri; sebaliknya, ia menghantar beban kerja kepada komputer kuantum yang sesuai, di mana persekitaran pelaksanaan runtime melakukan pelaksanaan sebenar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Historically, this cloud service was also called Qiskit Runtime Service, even though it is conceptually different from the runtime itself. This dual use of the term Qiskit Runtime &mdash; to describe both the execution environment and the managed cloud service &mdash; blurred the architecture and made it difficult to distinguish the open-source components from the managed cloud offering.\n"
msgstr "    Secara sejarahnya, perkhidmatan awan ini juga dipanggil Qiskit Runtime Service, walaupun ia secara konseptual berbeza daripada runtime itu sendiri. Penggunaan berganda istilah Qiskit Runtime ini &mdash; untuk menerangkan kedua-dua persekitaran pelaksanaan dan perkhidmatan awan terurus &mdash; mengaburkan seni bina dan menyukarkan pembezaan komponen sumber terbuka daripada tawaran awan terurus.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Renaming Qiskit Runtime Service to IBM Quantum Compute Service resolves this ambiguity. The resulting architecture becomes much clearer:\n"
msgstr "    Penukaran nama Qiskit Runtime Service kepada IBM Quantum Compute Service menyelesaikan kekaburan ini. Seni bina yang terhasil menjadi lebih jelas:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-runtime`: the open-source Qiskit extension that submits workloads.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-ibm-runtime`: sambungan Qiskit sumber terbuka yang menghantar beban kerja.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service: the managed cloud service that authenticates, schedules, manages, and routes workloads.\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service: perkhidmatan awan terurus yang mengesahkan, menjadualkan, menguruskan, dan menghalakan beban kerja.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Qiskit Runtime (or IBM Qiskit Runtime Execution Environment): the execution environment running on the quantum computer that processes and executes Qiskit primitives.\n"
msgstr "IBM Qiskit Runtime (atau Persekitaran Pelaksanaan IBM Qiskit Runtime): persekitaran pelaksanaan yang berjalan pada komputer kuantum yang memproses dan melaksanakan primitif Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "May 2026 {#may-2026}"
msgstr "Mei 2026 {#may-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"store-instruction\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Store instruction {#store-instruction}"
msgstr "Arahan Store {#store-instruction}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Support for the [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction on IBM&reg; QPUs** - Now you can simplify complex classical computations in your quantum circuits with the Store instruction.\n"
msgstr "**Sokongan untuk arahan [Store](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) pada QPU IBM&reg;** - Kini anda boleh memudahkan pengiraan klasik yang kompleks dalam litar kuantum anda dengan arahan Store.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute a classical expression mid-circuit and save the result to a variable or register, which can then immediately control subsequent quantum gates.  Instead of deeply nested inline expressions, you can break computations into named intermediate steps, so that complex classical feedback logic is easier to read and maintain. **Common use cases** include the following:\n"
msgstr "Kira ungkapan klasik pada pertengahan litar dan simpan hasilnya ke dalam pemboleh ubah atau daftar, yang kemudiannya boleh terus mengawal get kuantum berikutnya. Daripada ungkapan bersarang mendalam, anda boleh memecahkan pengiraan kepada langkah pertengahan bernama, supaya logik maklum balas klasik yang kompleks lebih mudah dibaca dan diselenggara. **Kes penggunaan biasa** termasuk yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic circuits with mid-circuit measurements and classical feedback  \n"
msgstr "Litar dinamik dengan pengukuran pertengahan litar dan maklum balas klasik  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Long-range entanglement preparation  \n"
msgstr "Penyediaan keterikatan jarak jauh  \n"

#. type: Bullet: '      * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complex conditional logic based on measurement outcomes\n"
msgstr "Logik bersyarat kompleks berdasarkan hasil pengukuran\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    To use the store instruction, first ensure you're running the latest version of `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-runtime`), then see the [documentation](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow#store) for more information and an example.\n"
msgstr "    Untuk menggunakan arahan store, mula-mula pastikan anda menjalankan versi terkini `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (`pip install --upgrade qiskit-ibm-runtime`), kemudian lihat [dokumentasi](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow#store) untuk maklumat lanjut dan contoh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    *Note that before submitting jobs, you should verify compatibility with each primitive's options in the documentation*: [Sampler options](/guides/sampler-options) | [Estimator options](/guides/estimator-options) | [Executor options](/guides/executor-options)\n"
msgstr "    *Perhatikan bahawa sebelum menghantar kerja, anda harus mengesahkan keserasian dengan pilihan setiap primitif dalam dokumentasi*: [Pilihan Sampler](/guides/sampler-options) | [Pilihan Estimator](/guides/estimator-options) | [Pilihan Executor](/guides/executor-options)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "April 2026 {#april-2026}"
msgstr "April 2026 {#april-2026}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"classroom-accounts\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classroom accounts {#classroom-accounts}"
msgstr "Akaun Kelas {#classroom-accounts}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New Classroom Accounts**: Professors can now request a [Classroom Account](/guides/classroom-accounts) to manage and facilitate access for their students. With Classroom Accounts, students can use Open Plan resources without needing to provide personal credit card information.\n"
msgstr "**Akaun Kelas Baharu**: Profesor kini boleh meminta [Akaun Kelas](/guides/classroom-accounts) untuk menguruskan dan memudahkan akses bagi pelajar mereka. Dengan Akaun Kelas, pelajar boleh menggunakan sumber Open Plan tanpa perlu memberikan maklumat kad kredit peribadi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New export options now available in IBM Quantum**: Introducing new export capabilities that make it easier for account administrators to analyze, share, and work with their data.\n"
msgstr "**Pilihan eksport baharu kini tersedia dalam IBM Quantum**: Memperkenalkan keupayaan eksport baharu yang memudahkan pentadbir akaun menganalisis, berkongsi, dan bekerja dengan data mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New in the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page:\n"
msgstr "Baharu pada halaman [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can now export charts in SVG or PNG format.\n"
msgstr "Anda kini boleh mengeksport carta dalam format SVG atau PNG.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can export all analytics data, including the data behind the charts, as CSV.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mengeksport semua data analitik, termasuk data di sebalik carta, sebagai CSV.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of each card on the page.\n"
msgstr "      Cari menu eksport di penjuru kanan atas setiap kad pada halaman.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New in the [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) page:\n"
msgstr "Baharu pada halaman [Access management](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export both the Users table and the Access Groups table in CSV format.\n"
msgstr "Eksport kedua-dua jadual Users dan jadual Access Groups dalam format CSV.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      Find the export menu at the top-right corner of the table.\n"
msgstr "      Cari menu eksport di penjuru kanan atas jadual.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**New resources and hardware for Open Plan users**: The [IBM Quantum Open Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) now features new learning resources, new hardware, and a special one-time promotion for eligible users.\n"
msgstr "**Sumber dan perkakasan baharu untuk pengguna Open Plan**: [IBM Quantum Open Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/products) kini menampilkan sumber pembelajaran baharu, perkakasan baharu, dan promosi sekali sahaja istimewa untuk pengguna yang layak.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new course, [Designing and leading quantum projects](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), is now available. This course covers key topics for users looking to develop or secure funding for a quantum project, including early-stage planning, team roles and responsibilities, identifying meaningful use cases, defining measures of success, and a guide to grant writing best practices.\n"
msgstr "Kursus baharu, [Designing and leading quantum projects](/learning/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-projects), kini tersedia. Kursus ini merangkumi topik utama untuk pengguna yang ingin membangunkan atau mendapatkan pembiayaan untuk projek kuantum, termasuk perancangan peringkat awal, peranan dan tanggungjawab pasukan, mengenal pasti kes penggunaan yang bermakna, menentukan ukuran kejayaan, dan panduan amalan terbaik penulisan geran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Heron r2 [`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;one of our highest-performing quantum computers&mdash;is now available to all Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Heron r2 [`ibm_kingston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston)&mdash;salah satu komputer kuantum berprestasi tertinggi kami&mdash;kini tersedia untuk semua pengguna Open Plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log 20 minutes of compute in any 12-month period and you can opt in to a special one-time offer: 180 minutes for the next 12 months.\n"
msgstr "Log 20 minit pengiraan dalam mana-mana tempoh 12 bulan dan anda boleh memilih untuk menyertai tawaran istimewa sekali sahaja: 180 minit untuk 12 bulan seterusnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      With expanded runtime and new educational resources, users can run everything from introductory circuits to advanced hybrid workflows.\n"
msgstr "      Dengan runtime yang diperluas dan sumber pendidikan baharu, pengguna boleh menjalankan segala-galanya daripada litar pengenalan kepada aliran kerja hibrid termaju.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "      These efforts reflect our commitment to open access, open education, and open science in quantum computing. Read more: [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates)\n"
msgstr "      Usaha ini mencerminkan komitmen kami terhadap akses terbuka, pendidikan terbuka, dan sains terbuka dalam pengkomputeran kuantum. Baca lebih lanjut: [Doubling down on open-access quantum computing](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/open-plan-updates)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Upcoming discontinuation of Qiskit Code Assistant service\n"
msgstr "  ### Penghentian akan datang perkhidmatan Qiskit Code Assistant\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  On 29 May 2026, IBM Quantum will discontinue the preview Qiskit Code Assistant service and archive the supporting extensions for Visual Studio Code and JupyterLab.\n"
msgstr "  Pada 29 Mei 2026, IBM Quantum akan menghentikan perkhidmatan pratonton Qiskit Code Assistant dan mengarkibkan sambungan sokongan untuk Visual Studio Code dan JupyterLab.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Based on feedback and usage patterns, more users are running Qiskit Code Assistant models locally and working in editor integrations that are already part of their development workflow.\n"
msgstr "  Berdasarkan maklum balas dan corak penggunaan, lebih ramai pengguna menjalankan model Qiskit Code Assistant secara tempatan dan bekerja dalam integrasi editor yang sudah menjadi sebahagian daripada aliran kerja pembangunan mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Qiskit Code Assistant models will remain available for local use. To continue using them, move to a local deployment and a community-supported editor integration or other local tooling.\n"
msgstr "  Model Qiskit Code Assistant akan kekal tersedia untuk kegunaan tempatan. Untuk terus menggunakannya, beralih kepada penggunaan tempatan dan integrasi editor yang disokong komuniti atau alat tempatan lain.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  For setup guidance, see the [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant) guide.\n"
msgstr "  Untuk panduan persediaan, lihat panduan [Qiskit Code Assistant](/guides/qiskit-code-assistant).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Nighthawk arrives in the EU\n"
msgstr "  ### Nighthawk tiba di EU\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! It is the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 QPU in the EU (`eu-de` region) and the second Nighthawk in our global fleet, after [`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) in the US (`us-east` region). `ibm_berlin` features faster two-qubit gates than `ibm_miami` (68 ns versus 138 ns, median) while maintaining similar fleet-leading coherence (T$_1$ of ~350 &#181;s).\n"
msgstr "  Premium dan Flex Plans kini mempunyai akses awal kepada [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin)! Ia adalah QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk r1 pertama di EU (wilayah `eu-de`) dan Nighthawk kedua dalam armada global kami, selepas [`ibm_miami`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_miami) di AS (wilayah `us-east`). `ibm_berlin` mempunyai get dua-qubit yang lebih pantas daripada `ibm_miami` (68 ns berbanding 138 ns, median) sambil mengekalkan koheren yang serupa terkemuka armada (T$_1$ ~350 &#181;s).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Since its release, Nighthawk has enabled research in regimes where classical simulation becomes increasingly challenging. Specifically, its architecture supports hardware-efficient workflows that map naturally onto grid-based (lattice) models. See recent papers from [Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) and [Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), and their collaborators, demonstrating simulation at scale on Nighthawk.\n"
msgstr "  Sejak pelancarannya, Nighthawk telah membolehkan penyelidikan dalam rejim di mana simulasi klasik semakin mencabar. Secara khusus, seni binanya menyokong aliran kerja cekap perkakasan yang dipetakan secara semula jadi kepada model berasaskan grid (kekisi). Lihat kertas kerja terkini daripada [Phasecraft](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.12236) dan [Volkswagen](https://doi.org/10.3390/e28040367), serta rakan kerjasama mereka, yang menunjukkan simulasi berskala pada Nighthawk.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Please note that `ibm_berlin` is currently an exploratory QPU that is still being tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of learning. As such, it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr "  Sila ambil perhatian bahawa `ibm_berlin` pada masa ini adalah QPU eksploratori yang masih diuji dan dioptimumkan sebagai sebahagian daripada kitaran pembelajaran berterusan kami. Oleh itu, ia buat sementara mempunyai had berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to 4 ms, which impacts QPU time required to execute workloads. Users can manually select a shorter repetition time, but performance might be degraded.\n"
msgstr "Masa pengulangan lalai telah ditingkatkan buat sementara daripada 250 &#181;s kepada 4 ms, yang memberi kesan kepada masa QPU yang diperlukan untuk melaksanakan beban kerja. Pengguna boleh memilih masa pengulangan yang lebih pendek secara manual, tetapi prestasi mungkin terjejas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit measurements is limited.\n"
msgstr "Litar dinamik belum lagi disokong, dan kualiti pengukuran pertengahan litar adalah terhad.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Upcoming retirements\n"
msgstr "  ### Persaraan akan datang\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  As we expand EU capacity and roll out the latest Nighthawk and Heron processors, `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` are scheduled to be retired on or around 30 April 2026.\n"
msgstr "  Sewaktu kami mengembangkan kapasiti EU dan melancarkan pemproses Nighthawk dan Heron terkini, `ibm_brussels` dan `ibm_strasbourg` dijadualkan untuk dipersarakan pada atau sekitar 30 April 2026.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Once these QPUs are retired, they will no longer accept jobs. If your workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please migrate to another active QPU ahead of the retirement date to take advantage of the latest systems. For guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Sebaik sahaja QPU ini dipersarakan, ia tidak lagi akan menerima kerja. Jika aliran kerja anda menyasarkan `ibm_brussels` atau `ibm_strasbourg`, sila berpindah ke QPU aktif lain sebelum tarikh persaraan untuk memanfaatkan sistem terkini. Untuk panduan mengenai cara mengambil data daripada kerja lepas, rujuk [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu) berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### `ibm_torino` is now retired\n"
msgstr "  ### `ibm_torino` kini telah dipersarakan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The quantum computer `ibm_torino` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on this QPU might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "  Komputer kuantum `ibm_torino` telah dipersarakan dan tidak lagi akan menerima penghantaran beban kerja. Sebarang beban kerja yang telah beratur pada QPU ini mungkin masih diproses dan mengembalikan hasil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on this QPU, refer to [these instructions](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Jika anda ingin mengambil data kerja daripada beban kerja penting yang dijalankan pada QPU ini, rujuk [arahan ini](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### ibm_brussels and ibm_strasbourg are now retired\n"
msgstr "  ### ibm_brussels dan ibm_strasbourg kini telah dipersarakan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  `ibm_brussels` and `ibm_strasbourg` have been retired and will no longer accept jobs.\n"
msgstr "  `ibm_brussels` dan `ibm_strasbourg` telah dipersarakan dan tidak lagi akan menerima kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  This change is part of the continued evolution and expansion of the IBM Quantum fleet in the EU, including the recently released Nighthawk QPU [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) and the upgraded Heron r3 QPU [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen). The global fleet has now fully transitioned away from Eagle, IBM Quantum's first utility‑scale processor family, introduced in 2021.\n"
msgstr "  Perubahan ini adalah sebahagian daripada evolusi dan pengembangan berterusan armada IBM Quantum di EU, termasuk QPU Nighthawk [`ibm_berlin`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_berlin) yang baru dilancarkan dan QPU Heron r3 [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) yang dinaik taraf. Armada global kini telah sepenuhnya beralih daripada Eagle, keluarga pemproses berskala utiliti pertama IBM Quantum, yang diperkenalkan pada 2021.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  If your workflows target `ibm_brussels` or `ibm_strasbourg`, please migrate to another active QPU to take advantage of the latest hardware. For guidance on retrieving data from past jobs, refer to the [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Jika aliran kerja anda menyasarkan `ibm_brussels` atau `ibm_strasbourg`, sila berpindah ke QPU aktif lain untuk memanfaatkan perkakasan terkini. Untuk panduan mengenai cara mengambil data daripada kerja lepas, rujuk [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "March 2026 {#march-2026}"
msgstr "Mac 2026 {#march-2026}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The EU gets its first Heron r3 {#the-eu-gets-its-first-heron-r3}"
msgstr "EU mendapat Heron r3 pertamanya {#the-eu-gets-its-first-heron-r3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Maintenance has been completed on [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) and the QPU is now back online in the eu‑de region.  `ibm_aachen` has also been upgraded to be the first QPU in the EU to feature the latest [Heron r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-up-on-an-earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k) processor. It is the third r3 in our global fleet, after [`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) and [`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) in the US.\n"
msgstr "  Penyelenggaraan telah selesai pada [`ibm_aachen`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen) dan QPU kini kembali dalam talian di wilayah eu‑de. `ibm_aachen` juga telah dinaik taraf menjadi QPU pertama di EU yang menampilkan pemproses [Heron r3](https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jay-gambetta-a274753a_following-up-on-an-earlier-post-https-activity-7364268815720824834-aZ0k) terkini. Ia adalah r3 ketiga dalam armada global kami, selepas [`ibm_boston`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_boston) dan [`ibm_pittsburgh`](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) di AS.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Heron r3 continues to deliver improved error rates and overall system performance compared to Heron r2, demonstrating more reliable execution and better results for workloads. For example, on `ibm_aachen`, we observe a large boost in $T_2$ (phase coherence time) from 150&nbsp;&#181;s to 250&nbsp;&#181;s. You can view metrics like these for all QPUs in the shared fleet on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page.\n"
msgstr "  Heron r3 terus memberikan kadar ralat yang lebih baik dan prestasi sistem keseluruhan berbanding Heron r2, menunjukkan pelaksanaan yang lebih boleh dipercayai dan hasil yang lebih baik untuk beban kerja. Sebagai contoh, pada `ibm_aachen`, kami memerhatikan peningkatan besar dalam $T_2$ (masa koheren fasa) daripada 150&nbsp;&#181;s kepada 250&nbsp;&#181;s. Anda boleh melihat metrik seperti ini untuk semua QPU dalam armada kongsi pada halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "February 2026 {#february-2026}"
msgstr "Februari 2026 {#february-2026}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### `ibm_torino` to retire\n"
msgstr "  ### `ibm_torino` to retire\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The `ibm_torino` QPU will retire on or around 1 April 2026. Once this QPU is retired, it will no longer accept jobs.\n"
msgstr "  QPU `ibm_torino` akan dipersarakan pada atau sekitar 1 April 2026. Sebaik sahaja QPU ini dipersarakan, ia tidak lagi akan menerima kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  If you would like to retrieve job data from important past jobs, please refer to the following [documentation](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "  Jika anda ingin mengambil data kerja daripada kerja lepas yang penting, sila rujuk [dokumentasi](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu) berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ### Increase in repetition delay time maximum\n"
msgstr "  ### Peningkatan had maksimum masa lengah pengulangan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To provide more flexibility for users, we have expanded the allowable repetition delay time range from 20-500 &#181;s to 20-2000 &#181;s on our Heron and Eagle QPUs. The Nighthawk QPU delay time range continues to be 1000-4000 &#181;s as previously announced. Note that if you choose to increase repetition delay (`rep_delay`), it will have a direct impact on your execution time and capacity consumption, but it might improve the fidelity of certain circuits. The default `rep_delay` remains unchanged on all QPUs.\n"
msgstr "  Untuk menyediakan lebih fleksibiliti kepada pengguna, kami telah mengembangkan julat masa lengah pengulangan yang dibenarkan daripada 20-500 &#181;s kepada 20-2000 &#181;s pada QPU Heron dan Eagle kami. Julat masa lengah QPU Nighthawk kekal 1000-4000 &#181;s seperti yang diumumkan sebelum ini. Perhatikan bahawa jika anda memilih untuk meningkatkan lengah pengulangan (`rep_delay`), ia akan memberi kesan langsung kepada masa pelaksanaan dan penggunaan kapasiti anda, tetapi ia mungkin meningkatkan kesetiaan litar tertentu. `rep_delay` lalai kekal tidak berubah pada semua QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can find more information about repetition delay time, including how to change it, in [Qubit initialization](/guides/repetition-rate-execution).\n"
msgstr "  Anda boleh mendapatkan lebih maklumat tentang masa lengah pengulangan, termasuk cara menukarnya, dalam [Pemulaan Qubit](/guides/repetition-rate-execution).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "January 2026 {#january-2026}"
msgstr "Januari 2026 {#january-2026}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The latest enhancements to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page include the following:\n"
msgstr "Penambahbaikan terkini kepada halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) termasuk yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet across the two regions. (You can still filter the Compute resources table by region using the funnel icon.)\n"
msgstr "**Paparan QPU bersatu** - Semua QPU merentas wilayah kini dipaparkan dalam satu jadual, memudahkan untuk melihat status dan kalibrasi armada kongsi merentas kedua-dua wilayah. (Anda masih boleh menapis jadual Compute resources mengikut wilayah menggunakan ikon corong.)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Single maintenance schedule** - The maintenance schedule is now at the top of the page, even when no events are currently planned.\n"
msgstr "**Jadual penyelenggaraan tunggal** - Jadual penyelenggaraan kini berada di bahagian atas halaman, walaupun apabila tiada acara yang dirancang pada masa ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**\"Instance access\" details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a new Instance access section shows all instances that grant the user access to that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr "**Butiran \"Instance access\"** - Apabila melihat butiran QPU, bahagian Instance access baharu menunjukkan semua instans yang memberikan pengguna akses kepada QPU tersebut untuk akaun yang dipilih.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The first Nighthawk QPU and latest Heron QPU are now available.** These two powerful new processors debuted at the [IBM Quantum Developer Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) in November.\n"
msgstr "**QPU Nighthawk pertama dan QPU Heron terkini kini tersedia.** Kedua-dua pemproses baharu berkuasa ini didebutkan di [IBM Quantum Developer Conference](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qdc-2025) pada November.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium and Flex Plans now have early access to `ibm_miami`, the first IBM Quantum Nighthawk QPU. Our most advanced quantum processor to date, Nighthawk is a 120-qubit device with a square-lattice topology (218 couplers versus Heron's 176) that is designed to support more complex workloads. Nighthawk has the highest coherence of our fleet - even higher than what was reported at QDC - with a median T1 of 350 &#181;s.\n"
msgstr "Premium dan Flex Plans kini mempunyai akses awal kepada `ibm_miami`, QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk pertama. Pemproses kuantum paling termaju kami setakat ini, Nighthawk adalah peranti 120-qubit dengan topologi kekisi segi empat sama (218 kopler berbanding 176 Heron) yang direka untuk menyokong beban kerja yang lebih kompleks. Nighthawk mempunyai koheren tertinggi dalam armada kami - lebih tinggi daripada yang dilaporkan di QDC - dengan T1 median 350 &#181;s.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that `ibm_miami` is currently an exploratory QPU that is still being tested and optimized as part of our continual cycles of learning. As such, it temporarily has the following limitations:\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahawa `ibm_miami` pada masa ini adalah QPU eksploratori yang masih diuji dan dioptimumkan sebagai sebahagian daripada kitaran pembelajaran berterusan kami. Oleh itu, ia buat sementara mempunyai had berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default repetition time has been temporarily increased from 250 &#181;s to 4 ms, which will impact QPU time required to execute workloads\n"
msgstr "Masa pengulangan lalai telah ditingkatkan buat sementara daripada 250 &#181;s kepada 4 ms, yang akan memberi kesan kepada masa QPU yang diperlukan untuk melaksanakan beban kerja\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic circuits are not yet supported, and quality of mid-circuit measurements is limited\n"
msgstr "Litar dinamik belum lagi disokong, dan kualiti pengukuran pertengahan litar adalah terhad\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, Premium, Flex, and Pay-As-You-Go Plans now have access to `ibm_boston`, our most performant IBM Quantum Heron r3 to date. It has demonstrated an EPLG at 100 qubits of 2.15e-3, with 57 of 176 possible two-qubit gates below the 1e-3 error level.\n"
msgstr "Selain itu, Premium, Flex, dan Pay-As-You-Go Plans kini mempunyai akses kepada `ibm_boston`, IBM Quantum Heron r3 paling berprestasi kami setakat ini. Ia telah menunjukkan EPLG pada 100 qubit sebanyak 2.15e-3, dengan 57 daripada 176 get dua-qubit yang mungkin berada di bawah tahap ralat 1e-3.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Introducing instance archiving for administrators on IBM Quantum Platform.** With this update, administrators can archive any instance within their account. Archiving an instance ensures that:\n"
msgstr "**Memperkenalkan pengarkiban instans untuk pentadbir pada IBM Quantum Platform.** Dengan kemas kini ini, pentadbir boleh mengarkibkan mana-mana instans dalam akaun mereka. Mengarkibkan instans memastikan bahawa:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collaborators retain access to results and QPU metrics, properties, and calibrations from past workloads.\n"
msgstr "Pekerja bersama mengekalkan akses kepada hasil dan metrik QPU, sifat, dan kalibrasi daripada beban kerja lepas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "No new workloads can be submitted to the archived instance, preventing unintended usage.\n"
msgstr "Tiada beban kerja baharu boleh dihantar ke instans yang diarkibkan, mencegah penggunaan yang tidak diingini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived instances do not subtract anything from your account's plan allocation.\n"
msgstr "Instans yang diarkibkan tidak menolak apa-apa daripada peruntukan pelan akaun anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All archived instances are neatly organized under a dedicated \"Archived\" tab.\n"
msgstr "Semua instans yang diarkibkan disusun kemas di bawah tab \"Archived\" khusus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '      - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrators can reactivate an instance at any time.\n"
msgstr "Pentadbir boleh mengaktifkan semula instans pada bila-bila masa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[**Directed execution model.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) This new execution model allows you to fine-tune error mitigation and other techniques without sacrificing performance by providing the ingredients to capture design intents on the client side, and shifting the costly generation of circuit variants to the server side. For example, you can use the [Samplomatic library](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) to define the exact layers in your circuits to apply Pauli-twirling and to inject noise. The new [Executor primitive](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) will then follow your directives to generate and execute the randomized circuit variants in Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "[**Model pelaksanaan terarah.**](/guides/directed-execution-model) Model pelaksanaan baharu ini membolehkan anda menala halus pengurangan ralat dan teknik lain tanpa mengorbankan prestasi dengan menyediakan bahan untuk menangkap niat reka bentuk pada bahagian klien, dan mengalihkan penjanaan varian litar yang mahal ke bahagian pelayan. Sebagai contoh, anda boleh menggunakan [pustaka Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/index.html) untuk menentukan lapisan tepat dalam litar anda untuk menggunakan Pauli-twirling dan menyuntik bunyi bising. [Primitif Executor](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) baharu kemudiannya akan mengikut arahan anda untuk menjana dan melaksanakan varian litar rawak dalam Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous updates {#previous-updates}"
msgstr "Kemas kini terdahulu {#previous-updates}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2025 {#2025}"
msgstr "2025 {#2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Fourth quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Suku keempat\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) quarterly update is now live!\n"
msgstr "Kemas kini suku tahunan [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) kini disiarkan!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This convenient wrap-up aims to get you started exploring the latest hardware, software, research, and community events from IBM Quantum and our partner ecosystem.\n"
msgstr "Rumusan mudah ini bertujuan membantu anda mula meneroka perkakasan, perisian, penyelidikan, dan acara komuniti terkini daripada IBM Quantum dan ekosistem rakan kongsi kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highlights include the recently deployed IBM Quantum Nighthawk and IBM Quantum Heron r3 QPUs, a call for submissions to the new open-source Quantum Advantage Tracker, and Qiskit C++, a new project designed to help HPC developers build production-grade quantum-centric supercomputing workflows.\n"
msgstr "Antara sorotan ialah QPU IBM Quantum Nighthawk dan IBM Quantum Heron r3 yang baru digunakan, seruan penyertaan kepada Quantum Advantage Tracker sumber terbuka baharu, dan Qiskit C++, projek baharu yang direka untuk membantu pembangun HPC membina aliran kerja pengkomputeran super berpusatkan kuantum bertaraf pengeluaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This quarterly update also spotlights notable benchmarks, including:\n"
msgstr "Kemas kini suku tahunan ini juga menyorot penanda aras penting, termasuk:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best EPLG: 0.23% on `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"
msgstr "EPLG terbaik: 0.23% pada `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best CLOPS: 330K+ across 7 QPUs\n"
msgstr "CLOPS terbaik: 330K+ merentas 7 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Total available qubits: 2,477 across 17 QPUs\n"
msgstr "Jumlah qubit yang tersedia: 2,477 merentas 17 QPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Total papers using IBM Quantum or Qiskit: 5,635\n"
msgstr "Jumlah kertas kerja menggunakan IBM Quantum atau Qiskit: 5,635\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Discover these updates and more](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025).\n"
msgstr "[Ketahui kemas kini ini dan lebih lagi](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute resources page update – Unified QPU view across regions {#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"
msgstr "Kemas kini halaman sumber pengkomputeran – Paparan QPU bersatu merentas wilayah {#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We’ve enhanced the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page! New features include the following:\n"
msgstr "Kami telah menambah baik halaman [Sumber pengkomputeran](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers)! Ciri baharu termasuk yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet across the two regions.\n"
msgstr "**Paparan QPU bersatu** - Semua QPU merentas wilayah kini dipaparkan dalam satu jadual, menjadikannya lebih mudah untuk melihat status dan kalibrasi bagi armada dikongsi merentas kedua-dua wilayah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Clearer \"Instance Access\" Details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a new Instance access section shows all instances that grant you access to that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr "**Butiran \"Akses Instance\" yang Lebih Jelas** - Apabila melihat butiran QPU, bahagian Akses instance baharu menunjukkan semua instance yang memberikan anda akses kepada QPU tersebut untuk akaun yang dipilih.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can still filter the Compute resources table by region using the funnel icon at the top of the table.\n"
msgstr "Anda masih boleh menapis jadual Sumber pengkomputeran mengikut wilayah menggunakan ikon corong di bahagian atas jadual.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"
msgstr "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The quantum computer `ibm_brisbane` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "Komputer kuantum `ibm_brisbane` telah dinyahtauliahkan dan tidak lagi akan menerima penyerahan beban kerja. Sebarang beban kerja yang telah beratur pada QPU ini mungkin masih diproses dan mengembalikan hasil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on this QPU, refer to [these instructions](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "Jika anda ingin mendapatkan data kerja daripada beban kerja penting yang dijalankan pada QPU ini, rujuk [arahan ini](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025}"
msgstr "Oktober 2025 {#october-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum fleet welcomes `ibm_fez` and `ibm_marrakesh` to the Open Plan! All users can access these computers as of 27 October.\n"
msgstr "Armada IBM Quantum mengalu-alukan `ibm_fez` dan `ibm_marrakesh` ke Pelan Terbuka! Semua pengguna boleh mengakses komputer ini bermula 27 Oktober.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A reminder that `ibm_brisbane` will retire on 3 Nov 2025, so plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr "Peringatan bahawa `ibm_brisbane` akan dinyahtauliahkan pada 3 Nov 2025, jadi rancang eksperimen anda dengan sewajarnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learn quantum computing in your own language**: We're excited to announce that translations are now available across all documentation and learning pages on IBM Quantum Platform! Translations have been the most-requested feature in user feedback, and now, quantum learning and development are more accessible than ever.\n"
msgstr "**Belajar pengkomputeran kuantum dalam bahasa anda sendiri**: Kami teruja untuk mengumumkan bahawa terjemahan kini tersedia merentas semua halaman dokumentasi dan pembelajaran di IBM Quantum Platform! Terjemahan telah menjadi ciri yang paling diminta dalam maklum balas pengguna, dan kini, pembelajaran serta pembangunan kuantum lebih mudah diakses berbanding sebelum ini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations of **tutorials, courses, documentation, and announcements** are now available in seven languages: French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish.\n"
msgstr "Terjemahan **tutorial, kursus, dokumentasi, dan pengumuman** kini tersedia dalam tujuh bahasa: Perancis, Jerman, Itali, Jepun, Korea, Portugis, dan Sepanyol.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Multilingual search**: Use the search bar to find what you need in your preferred language.\n"
msgstr "**Carian berbilang bahasa**: Gunakan bar carian untuk mencari apa yang anda perlukan dalam bahasa pilihan anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Downloadable resources**: Download resources such as guides or tutorials in the language that suits you best.\n"
msgstr "**Sumber boleh muat turun**: Muat turun sumber seperti panduan atau tutorial dalam bahasa yang paling sesuai untuk anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Localized API references**: Explore the latest version of the API reference and REST APIs with fully translated documentation (current versions only).\n"
msgstr "**Rujukan API yang disetempatkan**: Terokai versi terkini rujukan API dan REST API dengan dokumentasi yang diterjemahkan sepenuhnya (versi semasa sahaja).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Error messages & solutions**: Understand issues faster with translated error codes and suggested solutions.\n"
msgstr "**Mesej ralat & penyelesaian**: Fahami isu dengan lebih pantas dengan kod ralat yang diterjemahkan dan penyelesaian yang dicadangkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Find a translation error? Let us know! [Submit a translation issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml) in our GitHub repo.\n"
msgstr "  Jumpa ralat terjemahan? Beritahu kami! [Hantar isu terjemahan](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml) di repo GitHub kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  *Note that there is a processing delay between the publication of new content and its translation, so you might only see the English version of recently released content for a few days while the translation is underway.*\n"
msgstr "  *Ambil perhatian bahawa terdapat kelewatan pemprosesan antara penerbitan kandungan baharu dan terjemahannya, jadi anda mungkin hanya melihat versi bahasa Inggeris bagi kandungan yang baru diterbitkan selama beberapa hari semasa terjemahan sedang dijalankan.*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learning in IBM Quantum Platform** now has an updated home page to help you navigate the educational resources available, as well as two new catalog pages to help browse courses and modules. [Check out the updates!](/learning)\n"
msgstr "**Pembelajaran di IBM Quantum Platform** kini mempunyai halaman utama yang dikemas kini untuk membantu anda meneroka sumber pendidikan yang tersedia, serta dua halaman katalog baharu untuk membantu melayari kursus dan modul. [Lihat kemas kini terbaharu!](/learning)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
"- The new dynamic circuits is now available to all users on all backends, except some QPUs under the On-Prem Plan.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  With this new version, you can run dynamic circuits at utility scale. The initial release offers the following features:\n"
msgstr "  Dengan versi baharu ini, anda boleh menjalankan litar dinamik pada skala utiliti. Keluaran awal menawarkan ciri berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "75x execution speedup, thanks to the latest quantum execution stack\n"
msgstr "Peningkatan kelajuan pelaksanaan 75x, berkat timbunan pelaksanaan kuantum terkini\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel branch execution, which reduces circuit duration and improves result quality\n"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan cabang selari, yang mengurangkan tempoh litar dan meningkatkan kualiti hasil\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for [classical operations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) defined in Qiskit, with the exception of bit shift and arithmetic\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk [operasi klasikal](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) yang ditakrifkan dalam Qiskit, kecuali anjakan bit dan aritmetik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for stretch duration in delay instructions. This new type allows design intent to be captured at circuit construction time, and timing resolution at compile time\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk tempoh regangan dalam arahan lengah. Jenis baharu ini membolehkan niat reka bentuk ditangkap semasa pembinaan litar, dan resolusi masa semasa masa kompilasi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Additional features will be rolled out later this year.\n"
msgstr "  Ciri tambahan akan dilancarkan pada tahun ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  See  [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) and [Deferred timing resolution using stretch](/guides/stretch) for more information and code examples.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third Quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  Lihat  [Maklum balas hadapan dan aliran kawalan klasikal](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) dan [Resolusi masa tertangguh menggunakan regangan](/guides/stretch) untuk maklumat lanjut dan contoh kod.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third Quarter\">\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"
msgstr "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) helps capture the needs and concerns of anyone who works with quantum software - including you! The survey results provide valuable feedback for our team of Qiskit developers, and helps us to understand the broader quantum software landscape.\n"
msgstr "[Tinjauan Perisian Sumber Terbuka Kuantum Unitary Foundation](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) membantu menangkap keperluan dan kebimbangan sesiapa sahaja yang bekerja dengan perisian kuantum - termasuk anda! Hasil tinjauan memberikan maklum balas berharga untuk pasukan pembangun Qiskit kami, dan membantu kami memahami landskap perisian kuantum yang lebih luas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have a few minutes, please share the link or consider filling it out today! The survey is open through 3 October 2025.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda ada beberapa minit, sila kongsi pautan tersebut atau pertimbangkan untuk mengisinya hari ini! Tinjauan ini dibuka sehingga 3 Oktober 2025.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"
msgstr "[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"
msgstr "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We plan to retire `ibm_brisbane` on or around 1 November 2025.\n"
msgstr "Kami merancang untuk menyahtauliahkan `ibm_brisbane` pada atau sekitar 1 November 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once this QPU is retired, it will no longer accept jobs. If any jobs are queued on the QPU at the time of its retirement, they will still run and return results. Please plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr "Setelah QPU ini dinyahtauliahkan, ia tidak lagi akan menerima kerja. Jika terdapat kerja yang beratur pada QPU tersebut pada masa penyahtauliahannya, ia masih akan dijalankan dan mengembalikan hasil. Sila rancang eksperimen anda dengan sewajarnya.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "31 July 2025 {#31-july-2025}"
msgstr "31 Julai 2025 {#31-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, we are thrilled to announce the launch of ibm_pittsburgh, our first quantum computer powered by the new Heron Revision 3 (r3) QPU, and located in our Poughkeepsie quantum datacenter. r3 is the result of targeted improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout performance.\n"
msgstr "Hari ini, kami dengan gembiranya mengumumkan pelancaran ibm_pittsburgh, komputer kuantum pertama kami yang dikuasakan oleh QPU Heron Revision 3 (r3) baharu, dan terletak di pusat data kuantum Poughkeepsie kami. r3 adalah hasil daripada penambahbaikan yang disasarkan yang memberi kesan secara langsung kepada koheren, ketepatan get, dan prestasi bacaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The results speak for themselves, including an industry-leading ~350 us of T2 coherence; see the [latest metrics on Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) on IBM Quantum Platform. This steady, measured progress is at the center of our strategy for delivering reliable and performant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Hasilnya bercakap sendiri, termasuk koheren T2 sekitar ~350 us yang mendahului industri; lihat [metrik terkini pada Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) di IBM Quantum Platform. Kemajuan yang stabil dan terukur ini adalah tunjang kepada strategi kami untuk menyampaikan pengkomputeran kuantum yang boleh dipercayai dan berprestasi tinggi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As recently announced, today we retire one of our Eagle processors, ibm_sherbrooke. We invite you to migrate to our quantum computers powered by Heron processors, to take advantage of the lower error rates (approximately 5x lower EPLG) and faster gates (nearly 8x faster), leading to more performant circuits.\n"
msgstr "Seperti yang baru-baru ini diumumkan, hari ini kami menyahtauliahkan salah satu daripada pemproses Eagle kami, ibm_sherbrooke. Kami menjemput anda untuk berpindah ke komputer kuantum kami yang dikuasakan oleh pemproses Heron, untuk mengambil kesempatan daripada kadar ralat yang lebih rendah (kira-kira 5x lebih rendah EPLG) dan get yang lebih pantas (hampir 8x lebih pantas), yang membawa kepada litar yang lebih berprestasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Together, let’s open the door to more complex algorithmic exploration and real-world applications.\n"
msgstr "Bersama-sama, mari kita buka pintu kepada penerokaan algoritma yang lebih kompleks dan aplikasi dunia sebenar.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 July 2025 {#24-july-2025}"
msgstr "24 Julai 2025 {#24-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum technology is advancing rapidly, and it can be challenging to keep up. To help you stay in the loop, we’ve put together a roundup featuring the newest tools, performance improvements, and updates from IBM Quantum. It includes links to code examples, documentation, and research to help you get the most out of our latest developments.\n"
msgstr "Teknologi kuantum sedang berkembang dengan pantas, dan mungkin sukar untuk terus mengikutinya. Untuk membantu anda kekal maklum, kami telah menyusun rumusan yang memaparkan alatan terbaharu, penambahbaikan prestasi, dan kemas kini daripada IBM Quantum. Ia termasuk pautan kepada contoh kod, dokumentasi, dan penyelidikan untuk membantu anda memanfaatkan sepenuhnya perkembangan terkini kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Learn what's new at IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"
msgstr "[Ketahui apa yang baharu di IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "27 June 2025 {#27-june-2025}"
msgstr "27 Jun 2025 {#27-june-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_sherbrooke` will now retire on or around 28 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "`ibm_sherbrooke` kini akan dinyahtauliahkan pada atau sekitar 28 Julai 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before it is retired.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan anda mendapatkan sebarang data kerja daripada kerja lampau yang penting sebelum ia dinyahtauliahkan.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 June 2025 {#24-june-2025}"
msgstr "24 Jun 2025 {#24-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Profile page: Now you can find integrated profile details directly in the new platform. Find your profile by clicking on the user icon in the top right or visiting your [profile page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile).\n"
msgstr "Halaman profil: Kini anda boleh mendapati butiran profil bersepadu terus dalam platform baharu. Cari profil anda dengan mengklik ikon pengguna di sebelah kanan atas atau melawat [halaman profil](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile) anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public backends: View a list of US backends without logging in, available on the updated [Compute Resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page.\n"
msgstr "Backend awam: Lihat senarai backend AS tanpa log masuk, tersedia pada halaman [Sumber Pengkomputeran](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) yang dikemas kini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learning: Quantum computing courses have now been released in the upgraded platform, along with new educational modules designed to help teachers bring Qiskit into their classrooms. This is the first step towards migrating IBM Quantum Learning to the new platform, with more resources to be released in the coming weeks. Resources can be accessed without needing to log in at [IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Check out new and updated content, including [Quantum diagonalization algorithms](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum computing in practice](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), and Qiskit in Classrooms modules like [Quantum mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-mechanics) and [Computer science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"
msgstr "Pembelajaran: Kursus pengkomputeran kuantum kini telah dikeluarkan dalam platform yang dinaik taraf, bersama-sama modul pendidikan baharu yang direka untuk membantu guru membawa Qiskit ke dalam bilik darjah mereka. Ini adalah langkah pertama ke arah memindahkan IBM Quantum Learning ke platform baharu, dengan lebih banyak sumber akan dikeluarkan dalam minggu-minggu akan datang. Sumber boleh diakses tanpa perlu log masuk di [IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Lihat kandungan baharu dan dikemas kini, termasuk [Algoritma pepenjuruan kuantum](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms), [Pengkomputeran kuantum dalam amalan](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), dan modul Qiskit in Classrooms seperti [Mekanik kuantum](/learning/modules/quantum-mechanics) dan [Sains komputer](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Composer: The circuit-building [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) has now been migrated to the new platform. The experience is largely the same, except for files will no longer be stored in the platform, and will need to be downloaded locally. Find more details in the [Composer documentation](/guides/composer).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Composer: [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) pembinaan litar kini telah dipindahkan ke platform baharu. Pengalaman kekal secara umumnya sama, kecuali fail tidak lagi akan disimpan dalam platform, dan perlu dimuat turun secara setempat. Dapatkan lebih banyak butiran dalam [dokumentasi Composer](/guides/composer).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Announcements: Now you can access news, software updates, and service alerts on the new platform. Click the bell icon in the top navigation bar or the link under Featured resources on the [home page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) to visit the new Announcements page.\n"
msgstr "Pengumuman: Kini anda boleh mengakses berita, kemas kini perisian, dan amaran perkhidmatan pada platform baharu. Klik ikon loceng pada bar navigasi atas atau pautan di bawah Sumber Pilihan pada [halaman utama](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) untuk melawat halaman Pengumuman baharu.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025}"
msgstr "5 Jun 2025 {#5-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Added instance job filter: The platform now displays only your workloads by default. On the dashboard, you will see only the latest workloads you have submitted to instances within your account.\n"
msgstr "Menambah penapis kerja instance: Platform kini memaparkan hanya beban kerja anda secara lalai. Pada papan pemuka, anda hanya akan melihat beban kerja terkini yang anda telah hantar kepada instance dalam akaun anda.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Only the latest workloads now shown by default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Only the latest workloads now shown by default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new qiskit-ibm-runtime release, featuring:\n"
msgstr "Keluaran qiskit-ibm-runtime baharu, dengan ciri:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for private jobs for developers of Qiskit Functions\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk kerja peribadi bagi pembangun Qiskit Functions\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new channel for the platform that makes instance selection optional, which simplifies account setup and backend access by automatically checking all available instances. This update benefits users who manage multiple instances or prefer a streamlined workflow without specifying instance details each time. Developers and researchers working across various projects with different levels of access and multiple backends will find this especially helpful.\n"
msgstr "Saluran baharu untuk platform yang menjadikan pemilihan instance sebagai pilihan, yang memudahkan persediaan akaun dan akses backend dengan menyemak secara automatik semua instance yang tersedia. Kemas kini ini memberi manfaat kepada pengguna yang menguruskan pelbagai instance atau lebih suka aliran kerja yang lancar tanpa perlu menyatakan butiran instance setiap kali. Pembangun dan penyelidik yang bekerja merentas pelbagai projek dengan pelbagai tahap akses dan backend akan mendapati ini amat membantu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now available: Early access to the new version of dynamic circuits on select QPUs. This new version will allow you to run dynamic circuits at utility scale and comes with improvements in speed, quality, and usability. Premium Plan and Flex Plan users interested in participating in this early access can [contact us](/guides/support).\n"
msgstr "Kini tersedia: Akses awal kepada versi baharu litar dinamik pada QPU terpilih. Versi baharu ini akan membolehkan anda menjalankan litar dinamik pada skala utiliti dan disertakan dengan penambahbaikan dalam kelajuan, kualiti, dan kebolehgunaan. Pengguna Pelan Premium dan Pelan Flex yang berminat untuk menyertai akses awal ini boleh [hubungi kami](/guides/support).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 May 2025 {#15-may-2025}"
msgstr "15 Mei 2025 {#15-may-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Note: This is relevant to IBM Quantum Platform Classic (at https://quantum.ibm.com/) only.*\n"
msgstr "*Nota: Ini hanya relevan untuk IBM Quantum Platform Classic (di https://quantum.ibm.com/).*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are still using [IBM Quantum Platform Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) at https://quantum.ibm.com, please note that it will no longer be accessible starting 1 July 2025. At that time, Open Plan access will only be available on the [new Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and you will no longer have access to this platform or its data. Download your data and migrate to the new platform as soon as possible to avoid interruptions in your work. See the migration guide for more details.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda masih menggunakan [IBM Quantum Platform Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) di https://quantum.ibm.com, sila ambil perhatian bahawa ia tidak lagi akan boleh diakses bermula 1 Julai 2025. Pada masa itu, akses Pelan Terbuka hanya akan tersedia pada [Platform baharu](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), dan anda tidak lagi akan mempunyai akses kepada platform ini atau datanya. Muat turun data anda dan berpindah ke platform baharu secepat mungkin untuk mengelakkan gangguan dalam kerja anda. Lihat panduan migrasi untuk butiran lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users of other plans (for example, Premium Plan or On-Prem Plan) should wait for specific instructions from their administrators before migrating.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna pelan lain (contohnya, Pelan Premium atau Pelan On-Prem) harus menunggu arahan khusus daripada pentadbir mereka sebelum berpindah.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "8 May 2025 {#8-may-2025}"
msgstr "8 Mei 2025 {#8-may-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), a new resource consumption offering, has been released.\n"
msgstr "[Pelan Flex](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), tawaran penggunaan sumber baharu, telah dikeluarkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) are now available on the platform to help users with use-case exploration.\n"
msgstr "[Tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) kini tersedia pada platform untuk membantu pengguna dalam penerokaan kes penggunaan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) has launched on the platform.\n"
msgstr "[Katalog Qiskit Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) telah dilancarkan pada platform.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updated Session OpenAPI schema: `backend_name` field is now nullable.\n"
msgstr "Skema OpenAPI Session dikemas kini: Medan `backend_name` kini boleh menjadi null.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"
msgstr "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance limits: Individuals can view [available time and usage](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), which displays alerts when approaching limits.\n"
msgstr "Had instance: Individu boleh melihat [masa tersedia dan penggunaan](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), yang memaparkan amaran apabila menghampiri had.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator permissions: Administrators can view overall usage, cycle period, and remaining time per plan in the Instances page.\n"
msgstr "Kebenaran pentadbir: Pentadbir boleh melihat penggunaan keseluruhan, tempoh kitaran, dan baki masa bagi setiap pelan pada halaman Instances.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Search: Search is now integrated and available for filtering documentation content, including guides and API references.\n"
msgstr "Carian: Carian kini disepadukan dan tersedia untuk menapis kandungan dokumentasi, termasuk panduan dan rujukan API.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Billing: Pay-As-You-Go users can find a link to billing by clicking the overflow menu for each instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr "Pengebilan: Pengguna Bayar Mengikut Guna boleh mendapatkan pautan kepada pengebilan dengan mengklik menu limpahan bagi setiap instance pada halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New sign-in option: Sign-in with Google is now available on the [sign-in page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"
msgstr "Pilihan log masuk baharu: Log masuk dengan Google kini tersedia pada [halaman log masuk](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bug fixes:\n"
msgstr "Pembetulan pepijat:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed failed batch sessions for Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Menangani sesi kelompok gagal bagi pengguna Pelan Terbuka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed batch sessions not closing properly.\n"
msgstr "Menangani sesi kelompok yang tidak ditutup dengan betul.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improved platform stability by improving error handling and better recovery.\n"
msgstr "Meningkatkan kestabilan platform dengan menambah baik pengendalian ralat dan pemulihan yang lebih baik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed an issue that prevented QPU metrics to be displayed for the QPUs in the eu-de region.\n"
msgstr "Menangani isu yang menghalang metrik QPU daripada dipaparkan untuk QPU dalam wilayah eu-de.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deprecation reminder: The deprecation date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "Peringatan penyahtauliahan: Tarikh penyahtauliahan untuk IBM Quantum Platform Classic telah ditetapkan kepada 1 Julai 2025.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"
msgstr "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_kyiv` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "`ibm_kyiv` telah dinyahtauliahkan dan tidak lagi akan menerima penyerahan beban kerja. Sebarang beban kerja yang telah beratur pada QPU ini mungkin masih diproses dan mengembalikan hasil.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"
msgstr "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updated navigation to remove duplicated pages:\n"
msgstr "Navigasi dikemas kini untuk membuang halaman berpendua:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Administration section has been renamed \"Access management\" and now only focuses on managing users and access groups.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian Administration telah dinamakan semula \"Access management\" dan kini hanya menumpukan pada pengurusan pengguna dan kumpulan akses.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is only one page each for managing instances and workloads; there are no longer separate pages for each in the Administration section.  Instead, what you can view and manage on each page is dependent on your access and permissions.\n"
msgstr "Hanya terdapat satu halaman untuk pengurusan instance dan beban kerja masing-masing; tidak lagi terdapat halaman berasingan untuk setiap satu dalam bahagian Administration. Sebaliknya, apa yang anda boleh lihat dan urus pada setiap halaman bergantung kepada akses dan kebenaran anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The analytics page (visible only to those with certain access) has been moved into the main navigation menu, to make it easier to find.\n"
msgstr "Halaman analitis (hanya boleh dilihat oleh mereka yang mempunyai akses tertentu) telah dipindahkan ke dalam menu navigasi utama, untuk memudahkannya ditemui.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launched two new QPUs: ibm_aachen (eu-de region) and ibm_kingston (us-east region)\n"
msgstr "Melancarkan dua QPU baharu: ibm_aachen (wilayah eu-de) dan ibm_kingston (wilayah us-east)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Individuals who can view the analytics page can now filter the data to view information per plan.\n"
msgstr "Individu yang boleh melihat halaman analitis kini boleh menapis data untuk melihat maklumat mengikut pelan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrators can now more easily add multiple individuals to an access group due to the addition of an existing account members table.\n"
msgstr "Pentadbir kini boleh menambah beberapa individu ke kumpulan akses dengan lebih mudah disebabkan penambahan jadual ahli akaun sedia ada.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium plan instance administrators can set the instance allocation as a usage limit, so that usage in those instances cannot exceed the time alloted. See the [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits) guide for instructions.\n"
msgstr "Pentadbir instance pelan premium boleh menetapkan peruntukan instance sebagai had penggunaan, supaya penggunaan dalam instance tersebut tidak boleh melebihi masa yang diperuntukkan. Lihat panduan [Tetapkan had peruntukan instance](/guides/allocation-limits) untuk arahan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the sunset date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "Ambil perhatian bahawa tarikh sunset untuk IBM Quantum Platform Classic telah ditetapkan kepada 1 Julai 2025.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"
msgstr "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two new 156Q Heron R2 QPUs, [ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), located in the EU region, and [ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), located in the US region, are now available.\n"
msgstr "Dua QPU Heron R2 156Q baharu, [ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), terletak di wilayah EU, dan [ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), terletak di wilayah AS, kini tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View the systems you have access to with your selected instance in the [Compute resources](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) page on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat sistem yang anda mempunyai akses dengan instance yang anda pilih pada halaman [Sumber pengkomputeran](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) di IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "27 March 2025 {#27-march-2025}"
msgstr "27 Mac 2025 {#27-march-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Cost limits for Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Pay-As-You-Go Plan users with sufficient access can now view and edit [maximum cost limits](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) for their instances.\n"
msgstr "**Had kos untuk Pelan Bayar Mengikut Guna** - Pengguna Pelan Bayar Mengikut Guna dengan akses yang mencukupi kini boleh melihat dan mengedit [had kos maksimum](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) untuk instance mereka.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Job management updates** - Now only administrators can delete workloads created by other users in an account, and collaborators will only be able to delete their own workloads.\n"
msgstr "**Kemas kini pengurusan kerja** - Kini hanya pentadbir boleh memadam beban kerja yang dicipta oleh pengguna lain dalam akaun, dan kolaborator hanya akan dapat memadam beban kerja mereka sendiri.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated authentication error messages** - Error messaging has been improved for account and authentication processes to reduce issues with signup flow. The [Support page](/guides/support) has been expanded with recommendations for troubleshooting and resolving common errors.\n"
msgstr "**Mesej ralat pengesahan yang dikemas kini** - Pemesejan ralat telah ditambah baik untuk proses akaun dan pengesahan bagi mengurangkan isu dengan aliran pendaftaran. [Halaman Sokongan](/guides/support) telah diperluaskan dengan cadangan untuk penyelesaian masalah dan menyelesaikan ralat biasa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Increased default data retention** - The default data retention period for the new IBM Quantum Platform has been increased to three years, up from one year on IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"
msgstr "**Peningkatan pengekalan data lalai** - Tempoh pengekalan data lalai untuk IBM Quantum Platform baharu telah ditingkatkan kepada tiga tahun, daripada satu tahun pada IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resolved inconsistent behavior due to caching** - Some inconsistent behavior seen when updating instance limits, tags, and QPU resources has been resolved, which was due to caching.\n"
msgstr "**Menyelesaikan tingkah laku tidak konsisten disebabkan caching** - Beberapa tingkah laku tidak konsisten yang dilihat semasa mengemas kini had instance, tag, dan sumber QPU telah diselesaikan, yang disebabkan oleh caching.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For full details on the early access release and upcoming improvements, [check out the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"
msgstr "Untuk butiran lengkap mengenai keluaran akses awal dan penambahbaikan akan datang, [lihat blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "25 March 2025 {#25-march-2025}"
msgstr "25 Mac 2025 {#25-march-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Network exclusive: Join us for our first quarterly IBM Quantum Product Updates Webinar, a series in which we unveil the latest advancements in our products and offerings, showcase partner use cases, and provide the opportunity for Q&A with quantum experts.\n"
msgstr "Eksklusif IBM Quantum Network: Sertai kami untuk Webinar Kemas Kini Produk IBM Quantum suku tahunan pertama kami, satu siri di mana kami mendedahkan kemajuan terkini dalam produk dan tawaran kami, mempamerkan kes penggunaan rakan kongsi, dan menyediakan peluang untuk sesi soal jawab dengan pakar kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the first segment, we will talk about the evolution coming to IBM Quantum Platform that is designed to enhance security, stability, and user experience. Our team will walk through the key updates, demonstrate new capabilities, and discuss how these improvements empower developers and users alike.\n"
msgstr "Dalam segmen pertama, kami akan membincangkan evolusi yang akan datang kepada IBM Quantum Platform yang direka untuk meningkatkan keselamatan, kestabilan, dan pengalaman pengguna. Pasukan kami akan menerangkan kemas kini utama, mendemonstrasikan keupayaan baharu, dan membincangkan bagaimana penambahbaikan ini memperkasakan pembangun dan pengguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The second segment will feature the launch of three new and innovative Qiskit Functions in the Qiskit Functions Catalog. Each function provider will present their solution, highlighting its unique features, use cases, and impact on the broader ecosystem. Attendees will gain firsthand insights into how these Qiskit Functions can be leveraged for real-world applications.\n"
msgstr "Segmen kedua akan mempamerkan pelancaran tiga Qiskit Functions baharu dan inovatif dalam Qiskit Functions Catalog. Setiap penyedia fungsi akan membentangkan penyelesaian mereka, menonjolkan ciri unik, kes penggunaan, dan kesan terhadap ekosistem yang lebih luas. Peserta akan mendapat pandangan langsung tentang bagaimana Qiskit Functions ini boleh dimanfaatkan untuk aplikasi dunia sebenar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Learn more and register today](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"
msgstr "[Ketahui lebih lanjut dan daftar hari ini](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "26 February 2025 {#26-february-2025}"
msgstr "26 Februari 2025 {#26-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, we are releasing an early access version of the upgraded experience, and invite you to [open an account and explore the new interface](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). We will continue to roll out updates over the coming months, with the end goal of creating an experience that looks and feels like the classic version of IBM Quantum Platform, but with greater functionality. We will eventually sunset IBM Quantum Platform classic, so stay tuned for updates.\n"
msgstr "Hari ini, kami mengeluarkan versi akses awal bagi pengalaman yang dinaik taraf, dan menjemput anda untuk [membuka akaun dan meneroka antara muka baharu](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Kami akan terus melancarkan kemas kini sepanjang bulan-bulan akan datang, dengan matlamat akhir untuk mencipta pengalaman yang kelihatan dan terasa seperti versi klasik IBM Quantum Platform, tetapi dengan fungsi yang lebih baik. Kami akhirnya akan menyunset IBM Quantum Platform classic, jadi nantikan kemas kini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note: If your IBM Quantum Platform access falls under a plan administrator (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, etc.), you will receive guided migration support through your administrator in the coming months. In the meantime, you are welcome to [create a free Open Plan account to explore the new platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Sila ambil perhatian: Jika akses IBM Quantum Platform anda berada di bawah pentadbir pelan (Pelan Premium, Pelan On-Prem, Program Startup, dll.), anda akan menerima sokongan migrasi berpandu melalui pentadbir anda dalam bulan-bulan akan datang. Sementara itu, anda dialu-alukan untuk [mencipta akaun Pelan Terbuka percuma untuk meneroka platform baharu](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 February 2025 {#24-february-2025}"
msgstr "24 Februari 2025 {#24-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our inventory is getting a makeover, and we will be retiring the following QPUs on or around 18 April 2025:\n"
msgstr "Inventori kami sedang mengalami pembaharuan, dan kami akan menyahtauliahkan QPU berikut pada atau sekitar 18 April 2025:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "ibm_kyiv\n"
msgstr "ibm_kyiv\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "~ibm_sherbrooke~ UPDATE: ibm_sherbrooke will stay active for several more weeks after 18 April 2025.\n"
msgstr "~ibm_sherbrooke~ KEMAS KINI: ibm_sherbrooke akan kekal aktif selama beberapa minggu lagi selepas 18 April 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before these QPUs are retired.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan anda mendapatkan sebarang data kerja daripada kerja lampau yang penting sebelum QPU ini dinyahtauliahkan.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 February 2025 {#3-february-2025}"
msgstr "3 Februari 2025 {#3-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pulse-level control on all IBM Quantum processors has been removed.  Additionally, the pulse module is scheduled for removal in Qiskit SDK v2.0.  Instead, you can use fractional gates that are now built into the Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). For full details and help migrating your code, refer to [Migrate from Qiskit Pulse to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr "Kawalan peringkat denyut pada semua pemproses IBM Quantum telah dialih keluar. Selain itu, modul denyut dijadualkan untuk dialih keluar dalam Qiskit SDK v2.0. Sebaliknya, anda boleh menggunakan get pecahan yang kini terbina dalam Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). Untuk butiran lengkap dan bantuan berpindah kod anda, rujuk [Berpindah daripada Qiskit Pulse kepada get pecahan](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"new-version-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2 February 2025 {#2-february-2025}"
msgstr "2 Februari 2025 {#2-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Starting 2 June 2025 and continuing through the year, IBM Quantum will begin a gradual rollout of new features to [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) that will enable them at the utility scale.\n"
"Improvements include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"- Bermula 2 Jun 2025 dan berterusan sepanjang tahun, IBM Quantum akan memulakan pelancaran berperingkat ciri baharu kepada [litar dinamik](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) yang akan membolehkannya pada skala utiliti.\n"
"Penambahbaikan termasuk yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A 75x speedup in execution by using the Gen3 engine stack\n"
msgstr "Peningkatan kelajuan 75x dalam pelaksanaan dengan menggunakan timbunan enjin Gen3\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel execution of branches, which reduces circuit duration and improves result quality\n"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan selari bagi cabang, yang mengurangkan tempoh litar dan meningkatkan kualiti hasil\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improvement in mid-circuit measurement\n"
msgstr "Penambahbaikan dalam pengukuran pertengahan litar\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Better integration with dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr "Integrasi yang lebih baik dengan dynamical decoupling\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "More visibility of circuit timing information\n"
msgstr "Lebih banyak keterlihatan maklumat masa circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To accelerate the rollout, the following capabilities are now deprecated and will be no longer supported on or around 2 June 2025:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mempercepatkan pelancaran, keupayaan berikut kini dinyahkegunakan dan tidak akan lagi disokong pada atau sekitar 2 Jun 2025:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `while`, `for`, and `switch` control flow constructs\n"
msgstr "Konstruk aliran kawalan `while`, `for`, dan `switch`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ability to use control flow instructions inside the body of a branch (as in, nested control flow)\n"
msgstr "Keupayaan untuk menggunakan arahan aliran kawalan di dalam badan cabang (iaitu, aliran kawalan bersarang)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conditional measurements\n"
msgstr "Pengukuran bersyarat\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "7 January 2025 {#7-january-2025}"
msgstr "7 Januari 2025 {#7-january-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The rollout of the Gen3 engine stack begins today. This engine stack gives a 75x speedup in execution.  The rollout will be done on one QPU at a time, where a percentage of the jobs on the QPU will use the Gen3 path.  You can also force the Gen3 path using the `gen3-turbo` experimental option. Note that this engine stack is not compatible with fractional gates, pulse gates, or dynamic circuits.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Pelancaran tindanan enjin Gen3 bermula hari ini. Tindanan enjin ini memberikan peningkatan kelajuan 75x dalam pelaksanaan. Pelancaran akan dilakukan pada satu QPU pada satu masa, di mana peratusan kerja pada QPU tersebut akan menggunakan laluan Gen3. Anda juga boleh memaksa laluan Gen3 menggunakan pilihan eksperimen `gen3-turbo`. Ambil perhatian bahawa tindanan enjin ini tidak serasi dengan fractional gates, pulse gates, atau dynamic circuits.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2024 {#2024}"
msgstr "2024 {#2024}"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 October 2024 {#15-october-2024}"
msgstr "15 Oktober 2024 {#15-october-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for `backend.run` has ended.\n"
msgstr "Sokongan untuk `backend.run` telah tamat.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1 October 2024 {#1-october-2024}"
msgstr "1 Oktober 2024 {#1-october-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Parameterized delay gates have been deprecated.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Parameterized delay gates telah dinyahkegunakan.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Suku ketiga\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 August 2024 {#15-august-2024}"
msgstr "15 Ogos 2024 {#15-august-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now available for Estimator V2. See the [`ZneOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-options) for more details.\n"
msgstr "Kaedah mitigasi ralat Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) kini tersedia untuk Estimator V2. Lihat [rujukan API `ZneOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-options) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new helper program `noise-learner` is now available. It allows characterizing the noise processes affecting the gates in one or more circuits of interest, based on the Pauli-Lindblad noise model. The output noise model can then be passed to Estimator via the `layer_noise_model` option.\n"
msgstr "Program pembantu baharu `noise-learner` kini tersedia. Ia membolehkan pencirian proses hingar yang menjejaskan gate dalam satu atau lebih circuit yang diminati, berdasarkan model hingar Pauli-Lindblad. Model hingar output kemudiannya boleh dihantar kepada Estimator melalui pilihan `layer_noise_model`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "V1 primitives are no longer supported.\n"
msgstr "Primitif V1 tidak lagi disokong.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 July 2024 {#3-july-2024}"
msgstr "3 Julai 2024 {#3-july-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following endpoints are deprecated and will be removed on or after 3 October 2024: `GET /stream/jobs` and `GET /stream/jobs/{id}`. This removal has the following impacts:\n"
msgstr "Endpoint berikut dinyahkegunakan dan akan dialih keluar pada atau selepas 3 Oktober 2024: `GET /stream/jobs` dan `GET /stream/jobs/{id}`. Penyingkiran ini mempunyai kesan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the endpoints are removed, `job.stream_results()` and `job.interim_results()` will be removed from the [qiskit-ibm-runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) client.\n"
msgstr "Selepas endpoint dialih keluar, `job.stream_results()` dan `job.interim_results()` akan dialih keluar daripada klien [qiskit-ibm-runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    - Additional methods, such as `job.result()` currently use the deprecated endpoints.  Upgrade to `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 or later before the endpoints are removed to avoid disruption.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    - Kaedah tambahan, seperti `job.result()` kini menggunakan endpoint yang dinyahkegunakan. Naik taraf ke `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 atau lebih baharu sebelum endpoint dialih keluar untuk mengelakkan gangguan.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Suku kedua\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "18 June 2024 {#18-june-2024}"
msgstr "18 Jun 2024 {#18-june-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `optimization_level` option is deprecated for Estimator V2 and will be removed no sooner than 30 September 2024.\n"
msgstr "Pilihan `optimization_level` dinyahkegunakan untuk Estimator V2 dan akan dialih keluar tidak lewat daripada 30 September 2024.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 June 2024 {#3-june-2024}"
msgstr "3 Jun 2024 {#3-june-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now available as an experimental option for Estimator V2. See the [`EstimatorOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) for more details.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Kaedah mitigasi ralat Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) kini tersedia sebagai pilihan eksperimen untuk Estimator V2. Lihat [rujukan API `EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Suku pertama\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "28 March 2024 {#28-march-2024}"
msgstr "28 Mac 2024 {#28-march-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Qiskit Runtime primitives now support OpenQASM 3 as the input format for circuits and standard JSON output format. See [Qiskit Runtime REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) for examples.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  </Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Primitif Qiskit Runtime kini menyokong OpenQASM 3 sebagai format input untuk circuit dan format output JSON standard. Lihat [Qiskit Runtime REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) untuk contoh.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  </Accordion>\n"
